	(text "8 modulator data inputs (SD1/SD2 D1-D4) and one clock: XCLKOUT out, returned clock to all\neight SDx_Cy inputs. 3.3 V CMOS; for an adjacent sensing board only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127.734 124.3 0)
		(effects
